# PROBE range-assertion-inconsistent. r(a,b), range(r) = C, B(b) and B disjoint C: the ABox is inconsistent through the range.
# construct: ObjectPropertyRange
# expect: inconsistent

@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:B a owl:Class . :C a owl:Class .
:r a owl:ObjectProperty .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual . :b a owl:NamedIndividual .
:r rdfs:range :C .
:B owl:disjointWith :C .
:b a :B .
:a :r :b .
